			"date": "2024-08-27T14:30:40.726Z",
			"content": "<p>Found a pretty hefty blog post about concurrency benchmarks using the Nginx web server.</p><p><a href=\"https://blog.nginx.org/blog/testing-the-performance-of-nginx-and-nginx-plus-web-servers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">blog.nginx.org/blog/testing-th</span><span class=\"invisible\">e-performance-of-nginx-and-nginx-plus-web-servers</span></a></p><p>Looks like the slowest metric (1 CPU, HTTPS) handled 428 connections per second.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
