				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/322/028/040/622/495/original/af321586b1f6cd2d.webp"
			},
			"date": "2024-08-27T15:08:42.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> if you’re load testing, I start with typical traffic patterns and use a multiplier.</p><p>If stress testing, start small and ramp it up until it falls over.</p>",
