			"date": "2024-08-27T15:17:09.921Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mas.to/@williamoconnell\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>williamoconnell</span></a></span> yeah, that third blog post notes a hypothetical of 6.7k simultaneous requests—which seems like a lot!</p>",
