			"date": "2024-08-27T15:41:04.044Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mas.to/@williamoconnell\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>williamoconnell</span></a></span> I’d assume that is just a timing issue between writing of the blog post and the rollout of the 60s “jitter” addition—a temporary mitigation for sure.</p><p>Mastodon *could* upload the preview as an asset sidecar’d with the post, similar to any image upload.</p>",
